{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30928","headline":"寄宜阳兄弟 · 易重","name":"寄宜阳兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六年雁序恨分离，诏下今朝遇已知。\n上国皇风初喜日，御堦恩渥属身时。\n内庭再考称文异，圣主宣名奖艺奇。\n故里仙才若相问，一春攀得两重枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易重","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}